    [1005] = {1005, "Fire ardent", [[ The flames enveloppent the enemy, dealing $[4 5000$]$[3 4400$]$[2 5000$]$[1 4400$] fire damage all the 2 sec. Each times that the target suffers of the damage of 'Feu ardent', it receives a 'Marque of fire ardent'. When the effect expire or is dispelled, a tache of fire se forme, whose the taille is directement proportionnelle to the nombre of marques accumulées by the target. This effect can be dispelled to the help of spells of dissipation of curse or of magic. ]], 0, 0, 74562, 1652, 0, 0, 1000, 0, 416, 6, 2, -1, 0},
